      "fact": " By October 2025, electronics-parts makers had committed more than ₹1. 15 lakh crore (≈ USD 13. 6 billion) across 249 applications, reflecting strong industry response.  By January 2026, the Government of India approved 22 proposals under ECMS with a projected investment of ₹41,863 crore (≈ $5. 0 billion), estimated production worth ₹2. 58 lakh crore (≈ $31 billion), and creation of about 33,791 direct jobs.  The approved projects are spread across Andhra Pradesh, Haryana, Karnataka, Madhya Pradesh, Maharashtra, Tamil Nadu, Uttar Pradesh and Rajasthan"
