      "hint": "",
      "fact": " Archived from the original on 7 March 2009.  and its Moral Discontent\".  Economic and Political Weekly.  \"How wrong has the Indian Left been about economic reforms?\" (PDF).  Centre for Civil Society.  Archived from the original (PDF) on 26 February 2009.  Retrieved 25 February 2009"
