      "question": "_____ plateau is located in Gujarat state",
      "answer": "Kutch Kathiawar",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " This region is mostly semi-arid as it lies on the leeward side of both Ghats.  Much of the Deccan is covered by thorn scrub forest scattered with small regions of deciduous broadleaf forest.  Climate in the Deccan ranges from hot summers to mild winters.  Kutch Kathiawar plateau is located in Gujarat state.  The Kathiawar peninsula in western Gujarat is bounded by the Gulf of Kutch and the Gulf of Khambat.  The natural vegetation in most of the peninsula is xeric scrub, part of the Northwestern thorn scrub forests ecoregion.  ==== Ghats ==== The word ghati (Hindi: घाटी) means valley"
    },
