      "fact": " Flag Officer Naval Aviation (FONA) at Goa directs the field operations of the air arm.  Naval Air Arm operates eight Tu-142 aircraft, which entered service in 1988.  Upgrading of the aircraft is taking place, which helps to extend the service life of the aircraft by sixteen years.  The BAE Sea Harrier operates from the INS Viraat.  The BAE Sea Harrier FRS Mk.  60 flies with the INAS 300 and INAS 552 squadrons of the Indian Navy.  The Mikoyan MiG-29K will be deployed aboard INS Vikramaditya"
