      "fact": " Israel and India share intelligence on terrorist groups.  They have developed close defence and security ties since establishing diplomatic relations in 1992.  India has bought more than $5 billion worth of Israeli equipment since 2002.  In addition, Israel is training Indian military units and in 2008 was discussing an arrangement to give Indian commandos instruction in counter-terrorist tactics and urban warfare.  In December 2008, Israel and India signed a memorandum to set up an Indo-Israel Legal Colloquium to facilitate discussions and exchange programmes between judges and jurists of the two countries.  Following the Israeli invasion of Lebanon in 2006, India stated that the Israeli use of force was \"disproportionate and excessive\".  The India-Israel relationship has been very close and warm under the premiership of Narendra Modi since 2014"
