      "fact": " During the British era, Indians voluntarily went to jobs in Jamaica and the West Indies.  This has created a considerable population of people of Indian origin in Jamaica.  India has a High Commission in Kingston, whilst Jamaica has a consulate in New Delhi and plans to upgrade it to a High Commission soon.  Mexico Mexico is a very important and major economic partner of India.  Nobel Prize laureate and ambassador to India Octavio Paz wrote his book In Light of India which is an analysis of Indian history and culture.  Both nations are regional powers and members of the G-20 major economies.  India has an embassy in Mexico City"
