      "answer": "Cypriot Ministry",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " Cyprus Cyprus has a High Commission in New Delhi and 2 honorary consulates (in Mumbai and Kolkata).  India has a High Commission in Nicosia.  Both countries are full members of the Commonwealth of Nations.  Cypriot Ministry of Foreign Affairs: list of bilateral treaties with India India supported Cyprus during its struggle for independence from British colonial rule.  India supported the Greeks in Cyprus during the Turkish invasion of Cyprus in 1974 and lobbied for the international recognition of the Government of Nicosia as the sole legal representative of the entire nation.  India has consistently supported and voted for a peaceful resolution of the Cyprus dispute at the United Nations.  Georgia Georgia has an embassy in New Delhi"
