      "fact": " India and Russia signed an agreement on joint efforts to increase investment and trade volumes in the textile industry in both countries.  In signing the document included representatives of the Russian Union of Entrepreneurs of Textile and Light Industry Council and apparel exports of India (AEPC).  A cooperation agreement provides, inter alia, the exchange of technology and know-how in textile production.  For this purpose, a special Commission on Affairs Textile (Textile Communication Committee).  Counter-terrorism techniques are also in place between Russia and India.  In 2007 President Vladimir Putin was the guest of honour at the Republic Day celebration on 26 January 2007.  2008, has been declared by both countries as the Russia-India Friendship Year"
    },
