      "answer": "New Delhi",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " The Indian Embassy in Kyiv was opened in May 1992 and Ukraine opened its mission in New Delhi in February 1993.  The Consulate General of India in Odesa functioned from 1962 until its closure in March 1999.  India has an embassy in Kyiv.  Ukraine has an embassy in New Delhi and an honorary consulate in Mumbai.  United Kingdom India established diplomatic relations with the United Kingdom on 14 August 1947.  India maintains a high commission in London.  The United Kingdom is accredited to India through its high commission in New Delhi, as well as Deputy High Commissions in Ahmedabad, Bangalore, Chandigarh, Chennai, Hyderabad, Kolkata, Mumbai, and a Nationals Assistance Office in Goa"
