      "emoji": "",
      "question": "== E-_____ == The E-courts project was established in 2005 to digitize the courts",
      "answer": "Courts Mission Mode Project",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " Subsequently, women's rights and progressive groups called Bobde to step down for his insensitivity and incompetence.  Judicial Stress Judicial stress and mental health of judiciary, which has been a neglected topic has found recent highlight wherein, Madras High Court stated that the health of judges is affected due to workload.  Dr Edmond Fernandes, Honorary Director, Edward & Cynthia Institute of Public Health also highlighted how judicial stress snowballs into spinal problems, disc bulge, gastrointestinal problems, ergonomics issues and mental health capabilities.  == E-Courts Mission Mode Project == The E-courts project was established in 2005 to digitize the courts.  In 2008, all the District Courts were initialised under the project.  In 2010, all District Courts were computerised.  Digital services began in the Supreme Court in June 2011"
