      "fact": " The age range for admission in nursery is 3 to 4 years.  Lower Kindergarten (LKG): Also known as the junior kindergarten (jr.  The age range for admission in LKG is 4 to 5 years.  Upper Kindergarten (UKG): It is also called the senior kindergarten (Sr.  The age range for admission in UKG is 5 to 6 years.  LKG and UKG stages prepare and help children emotionally, mentally, socially and physically to grasp knowledge easily in the later stages of school and college life.  A systematic process of preschool education is followed in India to impart knowledge in the best possible way for a better understanding of the young children"
