      "fact": " Puneri Paltan, U Mumba, Pro Kabbadi, league teams are based in Pune and Mumbai respectively.  == Tourism == Maharashtra has a number of places that attracts national and international tourists.  The most popular or well known are Mumbai city, Ajanta, Ellora caves and the Nature reserves in the state.  Ajanta–Ellora are the UNESCO World Heritage Sites.  Mumbai, being the biggest and the most cosmopolitan city in India, attracts tourists from all over the world for its many attractions including colonial architecture, beaches, Bollywood, shopping, and an active nightlife.  The city attracts three million foreign and forty million domestic tourists annually.  The state wants to increase the numbers by allowing retailers and entertainment venues to be open 24-hours a day, seven days a week"
