      "fact": " From the early 2010s, Direct to Home has become increasingly popular replacing cable television services.  Tamil television serials form a major prime time source of entertainment.  === Others === Fire services are handled by the Tamil Nadu Fire and Rescue Services which operates 356 operating fire stations.  Postal service is handled by India Post, which operates more than 11,800 post offices in the state.  The first post office was established at Fort St.  George on 1 June 1786.  == Transportation == === Roads === Tamil Nadu has an extensive road network covering about 271,000 km as of 2023 with a road density of 2,084"
