      "answer": "Very Practical Ethics",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": " Oxford University Press.  A Companion to Applied Ethics.  Benatar, David (2024).  Very Practical Ethics: Engaging Everyday Moral Questions.  Oxford University Press.  ISBN 978-0-19-778079-4.  == External links == Applied ethics at PhilPapers"
