      "question": "What is Central Bank of India?",
      "answer": "Reserve Bank of India",
      "hint": "",
      "fact": "The Reserve Bank of India, (abbr.  RBI), is India's central bank, and the regulatory organisation for the Indian banking system and Indian currency.  It is owned by the Ministry of Finance, Government of the Republic of India, it is responsible for the control, issue, and supply of the Indian rupee.  It also manages the country's main payment systems"
