      "hint": "",
      "fact": " Digital Literacy mission will cover six crore rural households.  It was planned to connect 550 farmer markets nationwide through the use of technology.  Facilities to digitally empower citizens Digital Locker facility aims to help citizens to digitally store their important documents like PAN card, Passport, mark sheets, driving licence, Aadhaar card, and degree certificates.  Digital Locker will provide secure access to Government-issued documents.  It uses authentication services provided by Aadhaar, and is designed to eliminate the use of physical documents and enable the sharing of verified electronic documents across Government agencies.  Three key stakeholders of DigiLocker are Citizen, Issuer, and requester.  BPO and job growth: The government planned to create 28,000 seats of BPOs in various states and set up at least one Common Service Centre in each of the gram panchayats in the state"
    },
