      "hint": "",
      "fact": "Waheed Allahabadi (born Waheeduddin Ahmad; 1829–1892) was an Urdu-language Indian Poet. He was the teacher of Mubarak Azimabadi, Benazir Shah Warsi, Akbar Allahabadi and Shah Akbar Danapuri in poetry. He was a student of Khwaja Haidar Ali Aatish."
