      "fact": "The Luguburu Ghantabari Fair is an annual religious event for the Santhal tribal community, held in Lalpania, in Bokaro, Jharkhand. It takes place every year during Kartik Purnima and is centered around the Luguburu Ghantabari Dharamgarh, a revered religious site dedicated to Lugu Baba. The event attracts large numbers of Santhal devotees from across India and abroad, particularly from West Bengal, Bihar, Orissa, Nepal and Bangladesh also."
    },
